id: 2
hanzi: 则
pinyin: zé
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Measure Word

meanings_summary:
  en: measure word for pieces of news, stories, regulations, or advertisements; standard; rule
  es: clasificador para noticias, fábulas, artículos o reglamentos; norma; regla

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Measure Word | Standard | used as a counting unit for distinct textual items such as stories, fables, news reports, announcements, or written rules | clasificador para contar piezas textuales autónomas como noticias, fábulas, artículos breves o anuncios | 一则寓言 (a fable)
  2 | Conjunction | Literary | conjunction indicating contrast or logical consequence (equivalent to 'then', 'on the other hand', or 'in contrast') | conjunción literaria que expresa contraste o consecuencia lógica (por su parte, en cambio, entonces) | 穷则变，变则通 (in extremity there is change)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 今天的早报刊登了一则关于野生大象迁徙的新闻，引起了许多环保爱好者的热烈讨论。 | Jīntiān de zǎobào kāndēng le yì zé guānyú yěshēng dàxiàng qiānxǐ de xīnwén, yǐnqǐ le xǔduō huánbǎo àihàozhě de rèliè tǎolùn. | Today's morning paper published a news item regarding wild elephant migration, sparking lively discussion among environmentalists. | El periódico matutino publicó hoy una noticia sobre la migración de elefantes salvajes, suscitando un animado debate entre los ecologistas.
  #2 | 这两则流传千古的寓言故事短小精悍，却以生动的比喻阐明了不可片面看问题的深刻哲理。 | Zhè liǎng zé liúchuán qiāngǔ de yùyán gùshì duǎnxiǎo jīnghàn, què yǐ shēngdòng de bǐyù chǎnmíng le bùkě piànmiàn kàn wèntí de shēnkè zhélǐ. | These two time-honored fables are concise yet punchy, using vivid metaphors to elucidate profound philosophical truths against viewing issues one-sidedly. | Estas dos fábulas transmitidas por generaciones son breves y certeras, y valiéndose de elocuentes metáforas aclaran la honda lección de no juzgar las cosas de forma parcial.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  一则新闻 | an item of news; a news story
  一则寓言 | a fable; an allegorical tale
  成语两则 | two idiom stories
  一则广告 | a classified advertisement; a notice
  一则日记 | a diary entry
  原则规范 | principles and standards

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  以身作则 | yǐ shēn zuò zé | lead by personal example; serve as a model
  有则改之 | yǒu zé gǎi zhī | correct errors if you have committed them
  成则为王 | chéng zé wéi wáng | success makes a hero; might is right
  原则分明 | yuán zé fēn míng | adhere to clear, unambiguous principles

character_decomposition[1]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  则 | zé | rule; standard; measure word for items | norma; regla; clasificador de textos | 刂 | knife / cut | 刂 (knife, carving incision) | 贝 (bèi, value / shell) | 6 | 左右结构 | Originally depicted a sharp knife (刂) incising legal codes and regulations onto bronze ritual vessels or cowrie records (贝). | A sharp carver's knife (刂) precisely engraves an essential standard of value (贝) to create a binding rule (则). | Un cuchillo afilado (刂) graba con exactitud una norma valiosa (贝), fijando una regla o artículo indeleble (则). | 35 | BONI | 則

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: A legal carver incises rules and measures onto valuable tablets with a sharp knife (刂), producing each distinct measured article or story (则).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Con un cuchillo afilado (刂) se graba una valiosa norma (贝), dando origen a una regla o a una pieza escrita singular (则).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In ancient legalism and epigraphy, decrees were carved onto valuable bronze vessels with bronze knives. Thus 'zé' evolved from 'inscribed legal statutes' into a counting measure for discrete written clauses, journalistic dispatches, and classical stories.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: High-rising 2nd tone 'zé' (35). The pitch glides steadily upward from mid register (3) to upper register (5).

