semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 则 is an elegant, formal measure word dedicated to counting discrete textual, regulatory, or journalistic units.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 则 vs. 条 | tiáo | 则 is used strictly for written textual narratives, fables, announcements, and news dispatches (e.g. 一则消息), whereas 条 is far broader, classifying long slender physical items (绳子, 鱼) as well as legal clauses (一条规定).
    2 | 则 vs. 篇 | piān | 则 classifies short standalone announcements, notices, or micro-stories within a larger collection, whereas 篇 classifies complete, extensive standalone essays, articles, or chapters (一篇论文, 一篇文章).
    3 | 则 vs. 个 | gè | 则 confers a formal, literary, or journalistic register appropriate for published entries, whereas 个 is the generic colloquial classifier (一个故事).

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 随手翻阅古典笔记，几则意蕴幽深的小故事跃然纸上。古人用极为简练的笔墨勾勒出世态炎凉，每一则都闪烁着理性的光芒。这种凝练的文字力量，跨越时空依然能够直击现代读者的心灵深处。 | Suíshǒu fānyuè gǔdiǎn bǐjì, jǐ zé yìyùn yōushēn de xiǎo gùshì yuèrán zhǐ shàng. Gǔrén yòng jíwéi jiǎnliàn de bǐmò gōulè chū shìtài-yánliáng, měi yì zé dōu shǎnshuò zhe lǐxìng de guāngmáng. Zhè zhǒng níngliàn de wénzì lìliàng, kuàyuè shíkōng yīrán nénggòu zhíjī xiàndài dúzhě de xīnlíng shēnchù. | Leafing through classical anthologies at leisure, several deeply suggestive micro-tales leap from the page. Ancient authors outlined the vicissitudes of human affairs with minimal brushstrokes, each item radiating the brilliance of reason. Such condensed literary power transcends time, directly touching modern readers. | Hojeando relatos clásicos, varias viñetas de hondo significado cobran vida en el papel. Los antiguos esbozaban la complejidad humana con trazos sucintos; cada pasaje irradia lucidez racional. Esta admirable economía verbal trasciende las épocas y conmueve hondamente la sensibilidad del lector contemporáneo.
  #2 | 现代传媒环境下，每天都有成千上万则资讯通过算法推送到受众眼前。面对纷繁复杂的信息洪流，如何保持独立思考、从浩瀚的数据中甄别出有价值的内容，成为衡量现代公民信息素养的重要准则。 | Xiàndài chuánméi huánjìng xià, měitiān dōu yǒu chéngqiān-shàngwàn zé zīxùn tōngguò suànfǎ tuīsòng dào shòuzhòng yǎnqián. Miànduì fēnfán fùzá de xìnxī hóngliú, rúhé bǎochí dúlì sīkǎo, cóng hàohàn de shùjù zhōng zhēnbié chū yǒu jiàzhí de nèiróng, chéngwéi héngliáng xiàndài gōngmín xìnxī sùyǎng de zhòngyào zhǔnzé. | In modern media environments, tens of thousands of news dispatches are pushed before audiences daily by algorithms. Facing this torrent, maintaining independent reflection and discerning truly valuable content from vast data streams has become an essential benchmark of information literacy. | En los entornos digitales contemporáneos, miles de noticias y avisos son suministrados a diario a los usuarios. Ante esta marea informativa, preservar el juicio crítico e identificar el saber valioso entre la avalancha de datos se erige en pauta esencial de madurez intelectual.
